:203994019 a :Record ;
	:title "Stepwise source, a tool for progressive source code demonstration" ;
	:type "masterThesis" ;
	:description "This thesis, conducted as part of a Master’s Degree in Informatics Engineering at the University of Minho\nin Braga, Portugal, introduces Stepwise Source, a web application to aid in bridging gaps in programming\neducation, by tackling specific challenges faced by educators and learners. The primary goal of this\nproject was to develop a system that enabled educators to create progressive demonstrations of source\ncode construction in any programming language. Stepwise Source is the answer to this By presenting\ncode incrementally, it would allow learners to move forward or backward as they follow along. Additionally,\neducators can set challenges where students complete specific portions of the code with real-time feedback\non their answers. It is also possible to create branches in the presentation flow to show alternative\ncode paths that achieve different outcomes or to demonstrate multiple equivalent implementations for a\nprogramming concept. By offering flexibility for both guided interaction and independent study, this tool\nenhances the learning experience in programming education, offering a meaningful resource to support\nthe long and arduous journey of learning how to program." ;
	:language "eng" ;
	:rights "openAccess" ;
	:createdBy :João_Luís_Tibo_Machado_dos_Santos ;
	:contributionBy :Pedro_Rangel_Henriques, :Alvaro_Costa_Neto ;
	:hasSubject :Computer_Programming_Education, :Source_Code_Demonstration, :Education_Technology, :Ensino_de_Programação, :Demonstração_de_Construção_de_Código_Fonte, :Tecnologia_Educacional ;
	:issuedDate "2024-12-22T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
