:203993055 a :Record ;
	:title "Natural language-driven image retrieval for vehicle interiors: leveraging foundation models" ;
	:type "masterThesis" ;
	:description "Foundation models have become a transformative force in artificial intelligence (AI), especially in tasks\nrequiring multi-modal data processing. This dissertation focuses on leveraging foundation models, specifically\nBLIP-2, to develop a system that retrieves images of vehicle interiors based on natural language\nqueries, with intent of making the process of data curation more efficient. We tested BLIP-2 for its zero-shot\nretrieval capabilities in vehicle interior scenarios, such as detecting object placements, seating configurations,\nand human interactions within the cabin. To improve BLIP-2 performance on the vehicle interior\ndomain we used techniques like model probing and fine-tuning. We evaluated the model with different\napproaches (manual and automatic) and we were able to improve model retrieval@k performance from\n28.27% to 71.20%. The work was finished by integrating the model with a web-based tool where data\nscientists and machine learning engineers were able to query a vector database through natural language\nand retrieve images corresponding to their queries. Therefore, achieving the goal of making the process\nof dataset curation faster." ;
	:language "por" ;
	:rights "openAccess" ;
	:createdBy :Bernardo_Emanuel_Magalhães_Saraiva ;
	:contributionBy :João_M_Fernandes, :André_Leite_Ferreira ;
	:hasSubject :Foundation_models, :Visual_scene_representation, :Image_retrieval, :Automotive_interiors, :BLIP_2, :Zero_shot_learning, :Machine_learning, :Fine_tuning, :Natural_language_processing, :Multi_modal_AI, :Image_analysis, :Deep_learning, :Text_to_image_retrieval, :Vehicle_interior_monitoring, :Model_probing, :Natural_language_based_searches, :Modelos_Fundacionais, :Pesquisa_de_imagens, :Interiores_de_veículos, :BLIP_2, :Aprendizagem_zero_shot, :Aprendizagem_automática, :Processamento_de_linguagem_natural, :IA_multimodal, :Análise_de_imagens, :Aprendizagem_profunda, :Monitorização_de_interiores_de_veículos, :Pesquisas_baseadas_em_linguagem_natural ;
	:issuedDate "2024-12-22T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
